<title>UK: Regent Kingpin prices offer for Chile fund.</title>
<headline>Regent Kingpin prices offer for Chile fund.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-09-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Regent Kingpin said it would offer formula asset value less one cent calculated on October 14 for its Regent Kingpin Chile Value Fund shares while for warrants the price will be 13 cents, it said in a statement.</p>
<p>It said the offer is conditional on approval from relevant Chilean authorities to remit monies out of Chile and is open to acceptances until October 3.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7717</p>
</text>
